{"id":"SEC-001","category":"code_quality","criterion":"control_flow","severity":"HIGH","score":2,"file":"head/.claude/adapters/cheval.py","line":2119,"code_snippet":"_estimated = estimate_tokens(messages)\nif _estimated > _input_threshold:","reasoning_trace":"Traced the input estimate from the pre-flight (estimate_input -> ceiling.gate, counter may replace tokens; _walk_estimate set at :1842) into the per-hop loop. The I1 fit at :2090 uses _walk_estimate but the gate at :2118-2120 recomputes the heuristic and compares it with the same policy bound, so pre-flight and hop gate disagree for any prompt whose heuristic is above the bound and whose count is under it.","finding":"Walk-loop input gate compares the raw heuristic, not the pre-flight/counted estimate; dispatch accepted at pre-flight is skipped as ROUTING_MISS on every HTTP hop.","critique":"D-1.4 is defeated after the pre-flight; telemetry contradicts itself (preflight dispatch + count_tokens next to a ROUTING_MISS quoting the heuristic).","remediation":"_estimated = _walk_estimate if _walk_estimate is not None else estimate_tokens(messages); add an e2e row under the default policy with counter 175000 / heuristic 190000 on a 1M entry.","confidence":"high","references":["CWE-670"]}
